{
  "name": "sbm-declaration-services",
  "version": "1",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": "http",
      "name": "1 - Gonder (POST)",
      "seq": 1,
      "request": {
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/declarations/send",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "enabled": true
          },
          {
            "name": "X-User-Name",
            "value": "{{user}}",
            "enabled": true
          }
        ],
        "params": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "json",
          "json": "{\n  \"year\": {{year}},\n  \"month\": {{month}},\n  \"cityCode\": {{cityCode}}\n}"
        },
        "auth": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "script": {
          "req": "",
          "res": ""
        },
        "vars": {
          "req": [],
          "res": []
        },
        "assertions": [],
        "tests": "",
        "docs": "NEW ve ERROR durumundaki kayitlari (yil, ay, ilKodu, ilceKodu) bazinda gruplar ve her grup icin SBM'ye bir POST atar. Dar bir kume icin govdeyi {\"processIds\": [1, 2]} olarak degistirin. Yanit: { totalGroups, successCount, failCount, failures[] }. DIKKAT: gercekten SBM'ye veri gonderir."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "http",
      "name": "2 - Guncelle (PUT)",
      "seq": 2,
      "request": {
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/declarations/update",
        "method": "PUT",
        "headers": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "enabled": true
          },
          {
            "name": "X-User-Name",
            "value": "{{user}}",
            "enabled": true
          }
        ],
        "params": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "json",
          "json": "{\n  \"year\": {{year}},\n  \"month\": {{month}},\n  \"cityCode\": {{cityCode}}\n}"
        },
        "auth": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "script": {
          "req": "",
          "res": ""
        },
        "vars": {
          "req": [],
          "res": []
        },
        "assertions": [],
        "tests": "",
        "docs": "SENT / COMPLETED durumundaki kayitlari SBM'de gunceller. PUT govdesinde ay/yil/ilKodu/ilceKodu yer almaz; sigortaSirketKodu + sonOdemeTarihi + ysvDosyaNo + ysvTutarList gonderilir."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "http",
      "name": "3 - Sorgula (GET)",
      "seq": 3,
      "request": {
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/declarations/query/{{ysvDosyaNo}}",
        "method": "GET",
        "headers": [
          {
            "name": "X-User-Name",
            "value": "{{user}}",
            "enabled": true
          }
        ],
        "params": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "auth": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "script": {
          "req": "",
          "res": ""
        },
        "vars": {
          "req": [],
          "res": []
        },
        "assertions": [],
        "tests": "",
        "docs": "Beyannameyi SBM'den sorgular. Basarili olursa ilgili satirlari COMPLETED yapar. Yanit zarfi: { result, data, status }."
      }
    }
  ],
